&lt;b&gt;Boy Scouts launch their boats&lt;/b&gt;
  (Sep 11, 2004, 11:34am)

&lt;p align=left&gt;Even though the kayaking scouts started first, it took  so long for the four boys to get their kayaks launched that the canoe-using scouts left the canoe launch at the same time.&lt;/p&gt;
